        <mxCell id="absent" value="&lt;b&gt;Not in the account, by design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;no demo-ui ECR repository (push stays five)&lt;br&gt;no Terraform resource for the UI&lt;br&gt;Helm values-eks.yaml: enabled=false&lt;br&gt;nothing listening publicly for the UI&lt;br&gt;a static test in tests/aws/ checks all four&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=0;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="190" width="400" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gate" value="&lt;b&gt;Demo admin path (only with demo_admin_cidrs)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;public HTTP API, execute-api URL (never CloudFront):&lt;br&gt;ANY /carrier-admin/_admin/{proxy+} → VPC link → ALB&lt;br&gt;GET /internal/sent · POST /internal/reset → alerts&lt;br&gt;ANY /_admin/{proxy+} → binding page&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;authorizer admin_gate (Lambda REQUEST): sourceIp in the&lt;br&gt;CIDRs and Bearer DEMO_ADMIN_BEARER; no header 401, else 403;&lt;br&gt;X-Forwarded-For ignored; via CloudFront always 403&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DEMO_ADMIN_BEARER: keepers on the CIDRs, never the&lt;br&gt;internal bearer; each service checks it again&lt;br&gt;(SSM → make outputs → .env.aws)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;closed (default): no route, no rule, no SentSms → 404&lt;br&gt;close: demo_admin_cidrs = [] then make deploy&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5F8;strokeColor=#6B7583;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2B45;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="400" width="400" height="540" as="geometry" />
