        <mxCell id="never" value="&lt;b&gt;Never from the UI (O2): the human, in a terminal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;make ecr-up · ecr-outputs · push ENV=aws · plan · deploy&lt;br&gt;make outputs · seed-aws · cognito-users · register-gateway&lt;br&gt;make web-chat-sync · web-chat-url · latency-aws · test-nightly&lt;br&gt;make down ENV=aws · down-eks · deploy-eks · down-all&lt;br&gt;anything that reads AWS_* or a profile, any ENV=aws|eks target&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;the checklist shows these as copyable text only&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FA;strokeColor=#C9D3DF;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8A96A8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;dashed=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
